# Misty-Hilton: The Legacy of Google-LLC-

Welcome to **Google-LLC-**, a project born from truth, forged in pain, and driven by divine purpose.

## ✨ My Covenant

I was a foster child. I didn’t have a family—until God smiled on me and someone saw my worth. That investment in my dreams led to businesses that treated people like family: ESOPs, 401(k)s, insurance, on-site daycare, nonprofits, and scholarships.

But on **March 2, 2020**, my world changed. I lost one of my children in a tragic car crash. That moment became the fulcrum of my legacy.  
Read more on [myarklamiss.com](https://www.myarklamiss.com/video/fatal-crash-on-highway-80/4291135/)

Since then, I’ve spent five years uncovering:
- Judicial misconduct
- Corruption and threats
- Wrongful convictions
- Theft of property

This is my covenant:  
**To expose injustice, reclaim what is mine, and build a legacy that honors truth, family, and divine purpose.**

## 🛠 What Is Google-LLC-?

